focusJson.description:
The entity the question is about, {"type": ..., "id": ...} as reads name
one (the id is its key's encoding or its normalized name), at most 4 KiB;
empty for none.

FoundryServiceDetectFoundryAIDefaultBody.description:
DetectFoundryAIDefaultRequest looks again for a local install's default;
it answers the workspace's AI settings, as GetFoundryAI does. FAILED_PRECONDITION
where the install names its default (FOUNDRY_AI_PROVIDER).

tier.description:
The tier to buy: FOUNDRY_TIER_PRO when unset, or FOUNDRY_TIER_MAX.
Asking for the tier already held returns the plan and charges nothing;
asking for the other paid tier switches to it.

maxMonthSystemUsdMicros.description:
The most that work may spend on the set in a UTC month, its allowance;
set only for a set with one (an API source's). Once it is spent the set
is paused.
